{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposal has failed to&nbsp;demonstrate a clear justification for the high parking provision on-site thus failing to reflect the current approach of less car dependency. Further, the applicant failed to submit a transport statement, a parking design and management strategy, a deliveries and servicing strategy, an outline CLP nor sufficient details regarding the refuse and recycling storage. As such, this has resulted in a lack of clarity regarding the details of the proposed development and an inaccurate assessment. It cannot be confirmed that the development would not have a poor impact to the surrounding highways and thus is considered to be unacceptable and contrary to:Policies T6.4 and T7 of the London Plan (March 2021)Policies DMT 2, DMSI 8 and DMT 4 of the LBBD Local Plans (September 2024)"
  ],
